{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of accordions"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"accordions"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" components.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This provider should be integrated as a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllAccordionComponentTokensProvider"},{"text":" implementation inside ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":" so as to provide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":" implementation to use.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Custom themes can use subclass of ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"text":" and apply the provider they need.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It implements also the protocol ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AccordionComponentTokens"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AccordionFaqComponentTokens"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so as to expose the component tokens for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"accordions"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" through any ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accordions"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens spaces (from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and sizes (from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}]}}}